Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.98,0:00:17.93,main,Zanka,0000,0000,0000,,Rare for you to contact me, Enjin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.52,0:00:19.82,main,Zanka,0000,0000,0000,,What're you up—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.88,0:00:21.90,main,Zanka,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.94,0:00:25.21,main,Zanka,0000,0000,0000,,You found a natural talent?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.21,0:00:26.21,main,Enjin,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.21,0:00:28.72,main,Enjin,0000,0000,0000,,Happened across him in No Man's Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.08,0:00:32.22,main,Enjin,0000,0000,0000,,Turns out he's got powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.22,0:00:35.20,main,Enjin,0000,0000,0000,,Never seen anything quite like them, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:37.87,main,Enjin,0000,0000,0000,,I've recruited him for the Cleaners.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.19,0:00:41.16,main,Enjin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll introduce you two once I'm done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.69,0:00:42.87,main,Enjin,0000,0000,0000,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.83,0:00:47.51,main,Rudo,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, I never said \NI was joining your weird gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.51,0:00:49.77,main,Enjin,0000,0000,0000,,You think you're in a position to refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.77,0:00:52.26,main,Rudo,0000,0000,0000,,I told you, I've gotta get back up to the—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.26,0:00:54.56,main,Alice,0000,0000,0000,,You got lucky, kiddo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.56,0:00:55.87,main,Rudo,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-Who's this old man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.87,0:00:58.88,main,Alice,0000,0000,0000,,It takes a real dummy to go \Nwandering around in No Man's Land!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.88,0:01:03.09,main,Alice,0000,0000,0000,,If you'd breathed that air \Nfor much longer, you'd be dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.09,0:01:07.09,main,Alice,0000,0000,0000,,And you got yourself kidnapped to boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.09,0:01:09.44,main,Alice,0000,0000,0000,,Talk about {\i1}un{\i0}lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.44,0:01:12.40,main,Alice,0000,0000,0000,,You better thank the nice man over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:14.60,main,Enjin,0000,0000,0000,,You better thank me, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.60,0:01:16.14,italics,Rudo,0000,0000,0000,,Asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.56,0:01:20.20,main,Alice,0000,0000,0000,,And I'm an old {\i1}woman{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.20,0:01:21.88,main,Alice,0000,0000,0000,,Treatment's done!


